# Code ownership (kingdoms-services).
# Combined with the "main" ruleset (require code owner review, 1
# approval), no change merges without a maintainer. The org team is
# @merlin-pinpin-org/maintainers; until it exists, the fallback is
# the individual maintainer account.

# Default: a maintainer reviews everything
*                       @merlin-pinpin

# CI/CD workflows: the deploy path is security-sensitive
/.github/workflows/     @merlin-pinpin

# Docker and entrypoint: what runs on the VPS
/Dockerfile             @merlin-pinpin
/docker/                @merlin-pinpin
